1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,325
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:02:25,145 --> 00:02:27,965
This hexagram is Wind over Mountain:
Gradual Progress.

3
00:02:28,465 --> 00:02:29,761
Its judgment reads:

4
00:02:29,785 --> 00:02:31,205
"The wild goose gradually reaches the
plateau.

5
00:02:31,905 --> 00:02:33,485
The husband goes forth and does not return.

6
00:02:34,025 --> 00:02:35,685
The wife conceives but cannot give birth.

7
00:02:35,945 --> 00:02:37,405
Misfortune."

8
00:02:38,065 --> 00:02:39,281
Cannot give birth? Abbot,

9
00:02:39,305 --> 00:02:40,441
what does that mean?

10
00:02:40,465 --> 00:02:41,721
My husband and I

11
00:02:41,745 --> 00:02:43,721
long desperately for a child.

12
00:02:43,745 --> 00:02:45,081
We've consulted renowned physicians
everywhere

13
00:02:45,105 --> 00:02:46,325
and endured every treatment,

14
00:02:46,465 --> 00:02:48,321
yet our wish remains unfulfilled.

15
00:02:48,345 --> 00:02:50,485
Madam, there is no need to worry too much.

16
00:02:50,905 --> 00:02:52,281
Judging from the hexagram,

17
00:02:52,305 --> 00:02:54,485
the Chancellor is indeed destined to have a
son.

18
00:02:54,825 --> 00:02:55,965
It's just that...

19
00:02:56,585 --> 00:02:58,281
his blessings and longevity are somewhat
lacking,

20
00:02:58,305 --> 00:02:59,805
making heirs difficult to come by.

21
00:03:00,305 --> 00:03:03,005
But all hope is not lost.

22
00:03:03,305 --> 00:03:04,201
If you are willing

23
00:03:04,225 --> 00:03:06,201
to do good deeds and accumulate merit,

24
00:03:06,225 --> 00:03:09,201
perhaps Heaven's will can be changed.

25
00:03:09,225 --> 00:03:10,485
Wonderful.

26
00:03:10,745 --> 00:03:11,921
Husband,

27
00:03:11,945 --> 00:03:13,605
we will surely have a child.

28
00:03:19,105 --> 00:03:20,245
Abbot,

29
00:03:20,425 --> 00:03:21,761
from this day forward,

30
00:03:21,785 --> 00:03:23,445
on the first and fifteenth of every month,

31
00:03:23,665 --> 00:03:26,321
I will come to Lingquan Temple and fast for
three days.

32
00:03:26,345 --> 00:03:28,121
I will also enshrine a Buddhist altar here

33
00:03:28,145 --> 00:03:29,285
and worship with all sincerity.

34
00:03:29,585 --> 00:03:30,885
May Heaven show mercy

35
00:03:31,145 --> 00:03:32,601
and grant the Gu family a son

36
00:03:32,625 --> 00:03:33,801
to continue our bloodline.

37
00:03:33,825 --> 00:03:35,121
Your sincerity, Madam,

38
00:03:35,145 --> 00:03:37,325
will surely earn the Buddha's blessing.

39
00:03:38,385 --> 00:03:40,205
Amitabha.

40
00:03:48,145 --> 00:03:49,601
The Buddha is merciful.

41
00:03:49,625 --> 00:03:51,085
If I can have a son,

42
00:03:51,345 --> 00:03:53,005
I will give everything I possess

43
00:03:53,345 --> 00:03:54,565
to repay the Buddha's grace.

44
00:03:57,945 --> 00:03:59,645
Brother left in such a hurry this time.

45
00:03:59,985 --> 00:04:01,845
More importantly,
he was being so secretive.

46
00:04:02,025 --> 00:04:03,801
I wonder what he went to do

47
00:04:03,825 --> 00:04:05,041
and whether he's in danger.

48
00:04:05,065 --> 00:04:06,401
Don't worry, Sister.

49
00:04:06,425 --> 00:04:07,481
You know Brother.

50
00:04:07,505 --> 00:04:08,801
When it comes to food, clothing, and
comfort,

51
00:04:08,825 --> 00:04:10,481
he never mistreats himself.

52
00:04:10,505 --> 00:04:12,601
Besides, he knows martial arts.

53
00:04:12,625 --> 00:04:13,925
Nothing will happen to him.

54
00:04:14,945 --> 00:04:18,121
The three of us used to come pray for our
parents together.

55
00:04:18,145 --> 00:04:19,885
We always complained that he talked too
much.

56
00:04:20,345 --> 00:04:21,721
But now that he isn't here,

57
00:04:21,745 --> 00:04:23,521
it feels strangely quiet.

58
00:04:23,545 --> 00:04:25,285
I wonder when he'll return.

59
00:04:26,225 --> 00:04:27,721
Brother always thinks

60
00:04:27,745 --> 00:04:29,005
he is the least valued in the family.

61
00:04:29,785 --> 00:04:31,321
Yet after only a few days away,

62
00:04:31,345 --> 00:04:33,125
we all miss him terribly.

63
00:04:34,025 --> 00:04:35,605
Come in.

64
00:04:35,945 --> 00:04:37,765
Teacher. Madam.

65
00:04:38,025 --> 00:04:39,641
-Anhao.
-Leyan.

66
00:04:39,665 --> 00:04:41,645
You were absent from painting class
yesterday.

67
00:04:42,065 --> 00:04:43,325
Was something wrong?

68
00:04:43,825 --> 00:04:45,161
I recently caught a chill

69
00:04:45,185 --> 00:04:47,001
and was too unwell to attend.

70
00:04:47,025 --> 00:04:48,361
Have you called a physician?

71
00:04:48,385 --> 00:04:49,525
Uncle Gu.

72
00:04:49,865 --> 00:04:51,005
Aunt.

73
00:04:51,265 --> 00:04:53,321
Are you here to pray for blessings today?

74
00:04:53,345 --> 00:04:56,001
My husband and I came today

75
00:04:56,025 --> 00:04:57,841
to pray that the Gu family line continues

76
00:04:57,865 --> 00:04:59,725
and that we may be blessed with a child.

77
00:05:00,025 --> 00:05:02,041
Then I wish Teacher and Madam

78
00:05:02,065 --> 00:05:03,681
the fulfillment of your wish.

79
00:05:03,705 --> 00:05:05,285
-Sister.
-Leyan.

80
00:05:06,065 --> 00:05:07,281
Hurry.

81
00:05:07,305 --> 00:05:08,241
Coming.

82
00:05:08,265 --> 00:05:09,485
Did that hurt?

83
00:05:09,985 --> 00:05:11,445
I'm fine.

84
00:05:15,185 --> 00:05:17,925
Captain Di is truly considerate.

85
00:05:18,185 --> 00:05:19,801
Husband, look.

86
00:05:19,825 --> 00:05:22,081
They're young and such a perfect match.

87
00:05:22,105 --> 00:05:24,161
They don't look like siblings at all.

88
00:05:24,185 --> 00:05:26,005
They aren't blood siblings to begin with.

89
00:05:26,585 --> 00:05:28,521
Sister, it's getting late.

90
00:05:28,545 --> 00:05:30,205
Let's not delay our prayers for Father and
Mother.

91
00:05:30,865 --> 00:05:32,601
Teacher, Madam,

92
00:05:32,625 --> 00:05:33,965
we'll take our leave.

93
00:05:44,825 --> 00:05:46,921
Husband, you were rather rude just now.

94
00:05:46,945 --> 00:05:49,001
It was only a slight bump.

95
00:05:49,025 --> 00:05:50,405
Look how anxious you became.

96
00:05:52,025 --> 00:05:53,281
Just look.

97
00:05:53,305 --> 00:05:55,161
They're childhood sweethearts, a young man
and woman.

98
00:05:55,185 --> 00:05:56,641
But you,

99
00:05:56,665 --> 00:05:57,801
at your age,

100
00:05:57,825 --> 00:05:59,361
might fail to rescue the beauty

101
00:05:59,385 --> 00:06:00,885
and only injure yourself instead.

102
00:06:02,585 --> 00:06:03,845
This is sacred Buddhist ground.

103
00:06:04,025 --> 00:06:05,525
Do not speak nonsense.

104
00:06:05,865 --> 00:06:07,885
Precisely because we stand before the
Buddha,

105
00:06:08,145 --> 00:06:09,401
you should know even better

106
00:06:09,425 --> 00:06:11,285
which thoughts must never arise.

107
00:06:12,785 --> 00:06:14,165
Just now,

108
00:06:15,065 --> 00:06:17,365
seeing how worried you were

109
00:06:18,225 --> 00:06:19,841
reminded me

110
00:06:19,865 --> 00:06:21,245
-of how you once treated me...
-Absurd.

111
00:06:22,065 --> 00:06:24,125
Stop stirring up trouble with your words.

112
00:07:19,825 --> 00:07:21,765
Has Your Majesty been waiting long?

113
00:07:22,905 --> 00:07:24,245
I only just arrived.

114
00:07:39,985 --> 00:07:41,845
After the third boil, the tea is ready.

115
00:07:42,345 --> 00:07:44,321
Sit down and have some hot tea

116
00:07:44,345 --> 00:07:45,485
to warm yourself.

117
00:08:11,505 --> 00:08:12,841
Lord Meng has always been

118
00:08:12,865 --> 00:08:14,405
impartial and unflinching.

119
00:08:14,625 --> 00:08:16,445
Why are you so nervous today?

120
00:08:17,345 --> 00:08:18,685
The noodles are getting cold.

121
00:08:19,025 --> 00:08:20,285
Your Majesty, please try them.

122
00:08:32,785 --> 00:08:35,161
The Imperial Kitchen prepares
every delicacy under Heaven,

123
00:08:35,185 --> 00:08:36,485
from rare mountain fare to treasures of the
sea,

124
00:08:37,185 --> 00:08:39,925
yet none comforts the stomach like these
lamb noodles.

125
00:08:43,145 --> 00:08:45,001
Your Majesty has tasted every delicacy.

126
00:08:45,025 --> 00:08:47,161
Before discovering lamb noodles,

127
00:08:47,185 --> 00:08:48,765
was there any food you especially loved?

128
00:08:50,545 --> 00:08:53,565
Lord Meng, are you trying to learn more
about me?

129
00:08:54,465 --> 00:08:56,965
Your Majesty already knows my past,

130
00:08:57,585 --> 00:09:00,565
while I still know very little about yours.

131
00:09:01,145 --> 00:09:02,485
It is only fair.

132
00:09:09,225 --> 00:09:10,605
I still remember

133
00:09:11,025 --> 00:09:12,561
when I was young,

134
00:09:12,585 --> 00:09:14,245
my favorite food was thousand-layer cake.

135
00:09:15,785 --> 00:09:18,245
My mother made it for me.

136
00:09:18,905 --> 00:09:19,961
After she passed away,

137
00:09:19,985 --> 00:09:21,761
I missed her so desperately

138
00:09:21,785 --> 00:09:23,281
that I devoured

139
00:09:23,305 --> 00:09:25,321
all twelve boxes she
had left in the palace,

140
00:09:25,345 --> 00:09:26,401
until I vomited blood.

141
00:09:26,425 --> 00:09:27,805
From that day on,

142
00:09:28,665 --> 00:09:30,725
I no longer sought pleasure in food

143
00:09:31,145 --> 00:09:32,561
or developed a favorite.

144
00:09:32,585 --> 00:09:35,365
Food makes us nostalgic

145
00:09:36,065 --> 00:09:37,481
not only because of its taste,

146
00:09:37,505 --> 00:09:39,085
but because of whom it makes us miss.

147
00:09:40,305 --> 00:09:42,561
Just as apricot-skin cake

148
00:09:42,585 --> 00:09:44,365
always reminds me of Sister A-Xiang.

149
00:09:48,785 --> 00:09:50,121
Because of you,

150
00:09:50,145 --> 00:09:51,925
I will remember the taste of lamb noodles.

151
00:09:52,785 --> 00:09:54,285
Then for now,

152
00:09:54,665 --> 00:09:56,445
remember my chestnuts too.

153
00:10:10,785 --> 00:10:11,965
It's snowing.

154
00:10:26,825 --> 00:10:28,765
Snow is rare in Shazhou.

155
00:10:29,425 --> 00:10:30,961
Fu Zhi once told me

156
00:10:30,985 --> 00:10:32,645
that wishes made during the first snow
always come true.

157
00:10:33,665 --> 00:10:36,165
It's a pity we missed it.

158
00:10:38,665 --> 00:10:40,325
Why wait for snow to make a wish?

159
00:10:41,785 --> 00:10:43,645
I am more reliable than Heaven.

160
00:10:46,305 --> 00:10:47,761
I wish

161
00:10:47,785 --> 00:10:49,401
to capture Ling Yunfei,

162
00:10:49,425 --> 00:10:50,681
eradicate the Tiger Roar Gang,

163
00:10:50,705 --> 00:10:53,645
and bring peace and prosperity to Great
Ning.

164
00:10:59,665 --> 00:11:01,325
Does Your Majesty have a wish?

165
00:11:06,545 --> 00:11:08,281
This is outrageous. How improper!

166
00:11:08,305 --> 00:11:10,045
This...

167
00:11:11,505 --> 00:11:12,481
Then why are you speaking so loudly?

168
00:11:12,505 --> 00:11:14,045
Do you want the entire court to hear?

169
00:11:15,985 --> 00:11:17,961
How can His Majesty and Lord Meng

170
00:11:17,985 --> 00:11:20,401
meet privately in the Imperial Garden?

171
00:11:20,425 --> 00:11:21,681
A romance between sovereign and subject

172
00:11:21,705 --> 00:11:24,845
-is punishable by lingchi.
-Chief Steward You, mind your words.

173
00:11:25,145 --> 00:11:27,121
His Majesty is clearly discussing important
affairs with Lord Meng.

174
00:11:27,145 --> 00:11:29,041
No, just look...

175
00:11:29,065 --> 00:11:31,281
Is that how important
affairs are discussed?

176
00:11:31,305 --> 00:11:32,961
Dining and strolling through the snow
together?

177
00:11:32,985 --> 00:11:34,521
It is completely improper.

178
00:11:34,545 --> 00:11:36,445
No. I must go take a look...

179
00:11:38,505 --> 00:11:40,605
I wish for your wish to come true.

180
00:11:42,225 --> 00:11:43,441
And I hope

181
00:11:43,465 --> 00:11:44,845
that when the next season comes,

182
00:11:45,545 --> 00:11:47,205
old friends will still be by my side.

183
00:11:53,305 --> 00:11:55,845
Like me, Your Majesty has no family.

184
00:11:57,025 --> 00:11:58,681
Though all the people offer you homage,

185
00:11:58,705 --> 00:12:00,721
during festivals and the turning of the
year,

186
00:12:00,745 --> 00:12:02,525
you always keep vigil alone.

187
00:12:03,985 --> 00:12:05,565
Then I will make one more wish.

188
00:12:06,545 --> 00:12:07,921
I hope

189
00:12:07,945 --> 00:12:09,445
that through every season and festival,

190
00:12:10,465 --> 00:12:13,165
Your Majesty will always have someone by
your side.

191
00:12:20,145 --> 00:12:21,645
When spring returns and the flowers bloom,

192
00:12:22,025 --> 00:12:23,801
shall we release river lanterns together?

193
00:12:23,825 --> 00:12:25,525
It's a promise.

194
00:12:35,785 --> 00:12:37,285
Absurd!

195
00:12:39,145 --> 00:12:41,561
They met secretly in the Imperial Garden.

196
00:12:41,585 --> 00:12:43,121
Do they have any respect for court
propriety?

197
00:12:43,145 --> 00:12:44,601
Ever since the Metropolitan
Graduate case, I knew

198
00:12:44,625 --> 00:12:46,361
Meng Tinghui would become a source of
trouble.

199
00:12:46,385 --> 00:12:48,525
Now the whole capital is talking.

200
00:12:48,905 --> 00:12:50,565
Have you not heard?

201
00:12:51,025 --> 00:12:52,565
How are you watching over His Majesty?

202
00:12:53,105 --> 00:12:54,841
Lord Meng's past is tragic.

203
00:12:54,865 --> 00:12:57,041
His Majesty merely remembers their
friendship from youth

204
00:12:57,065 --> 00:12:59,001
and therefore shows her a little more
concern.

205
00:12:59,025 --> 00:13:00,201
These street rumors

206
00:13:00,225 --> 00:13:01,361
must not be taken seriously.

207
00:13:01,385 --> 00:13:03,281
His Majesty and Meng Tinghui

208
00:13:03,305 --> 00:13:05,641
have become the public's
favorite subject of gossip.

209
00:13:05,665 --> 00:13:07,481
This truly damages imperial dignity.

210
00:13:07,505 --> 00:13:09,601
But His Majesty looks every day

211
00:13:09,625 --> 00:13:12,481
at the ancestral maxim plaque presented by
the Left Chancellor.

212
00:13:12,505 --> 00:13:15,401
Surely he knows where to draw the line.

213
00:13:15,425 --> 00:13:17,201
Since His Majesty ascended the throne,

214
00:13:17,225 --> 00:13:18,761
the harem has remained empty,

215
00:13:18,785 --> 00:13:20,361
and he has no heir.

216
00:13:20,385 --> 00:13:22,281
Someone must inherit the realm.

217
00:13:22,305 --> 00:13:24,601
This old servant is worried too.

218
00:13:24,625 --> 00:13:26,121
But when the noble ladies performed last
time,

219
00:13:26,145 --> 00:13:27,441
His Majesty was not pleased.

220
00:13:27,465 --> 00:13:28,965
He flew into a rage instead.

221
00:13:29,265 --> 00:13:30,481
I was so frightened

222
00:13:30,505 --> 00:13:32,485
I couldn't sleep for several nights.

223
00:13:35,505 --> 00:13:37,681
Once His Majesty has an heir,

224
00:13:37,705 --> 00:13:40,765
his heart will naturally settle.

225
00:13:41,745 --> 00:13:44,125
What does the Left Chancellor intend to do?

226
00:13:55,065 --> 00:13:56,445
Chancellor.

227
00:13:57,145 --> 00:13:58,961
Rumors about His Majesty and Meng Tinghui

228
00:13:58,985 --> 00:14:01,325
are spreading everywhere.

229
00:14:01,745 --> 00:14:02,881
I have seen Meng Tinghui

230
00:14:02,905 --> 00:14:05,241
several times at banquets.

231
00:14:05,265 --> 00:14:07,925
She seemed dignified and gracious,

232
00:14:08,305 --> 00:14:10,401
nothing like the seductive temptress

233
00:14:10,425 --> 00:14:11,565
people describe.

234
00:14:12,105 --> 00:14:13,481
If His Majesty

235
00:14:13,505 --> 00:14:15,041
has truly fallen for her,

236
00:14:15,065 --> 00:14:16,685
it would hardly be surprising.

237
00:14:18,705 --> 00:14:21,121
A romance between sovereign and subject is
taboo.

238
00:14:21,145 --> 00:14:22,845
How dare you discuss it so casually?

239
00:14:23,305 --> 00:14:24,561
Within the next few days,

240
00:14:24,585 --> 00:14:26,925
send Wen Ruomei into the palace.

241
00:14:27,825 --> 00:14:29,161
Make Meng Tinghui

242
00:14:29,185 --> 00:14:31,245
give up all hope.

243
00:14:32,025 --> 00:14:33,401
Wen Ruomei

244
00:14:33,425 --> 00:14:35,281
is foolish and without strategy.

245
00:14:35,305 --> 00:14:37,365
How could she possess the bearing to rule
the realm?

246
00:14:37,945 --> 00:14:39,445
A woman's shortsighted view.

247
00:14:39,745 --> 00:14:42,881
For now, separating His Majesty from Meng
Tinghui

248
00:14:42,905 --> 00:14:44,685
is the best course.

249
00:14:44,945 --> 00:14:46,521
Chancellor,

250
00:14:46,545 --> 00:14:49,001
you devote yourself entirely to affairs of
state

251
00:14:49,025 --> 00:14:50,441
and never spare the time

252
00:14:50,465 --> 00:14:52,161
to consider our own son's marriage.

253
00:14:52,185 --> 00:14:54,401
You should at least worry about him

254
00:14:54,425 --> 00:14:57,725
and find him a woman of equal family
standing.

255
00:15:00,105 --> 00:15:01,561
If you and our son

256
00:15:01,585 --> 00:15:03,121
have a young lady in mind,

257
00:15:03,145 --> 00:15:04,681
say so directly.

258
00:15:04,705 --> 00:15:06,041
Among everyone at court,

259
00:15:06,065 --> 00:15:08,605
who would dare deny me?

260
00:15:08,865 --> 00:15:10,885
Father...

261
00:15:11,465 --> 00:15:13,841
Find me the finest matchmaker in the
capital.

262
00:15:13,865 --> 00:15:16,525
Your son has found a match made in Heaven.

263
00:15:18,105 --> 00:15:19,561
Our son has truly grown up.

264
00:15:19,585 --> 00:15:22,361
He finally knows how
to plan for his future.

265
00:15:22,385 --> 00:15:23,525
Come.

266
00:15:24,145 --> 00:15:25,285
Tell us.

267
00:15:26,185 --> 00:15:27,321
The woman I found

268
00:15:27,345 --> 00:15:29,881
is no ordinary beauty.

269
00:15:29,905 --> 00:15:33,121
She is a fairy descended
from the Jade Pool,

270
00:15:33,145 --> 00:15:35,321
Chang'e fallen from the moon palace,

271
00:15:35,345 --> 00:15:37,921
a peerless beauty of unmatched grace.

272
00:15:37,945 --> 00:15:39,805
Every smile and every glance...

273
00:15:40,305 --> 00:15:42,401
Our son certainly has excellent taste.

274
00:15:42,425 --> 00:15:44,885
Tell us. Whose daughter is she?

275
00:15:46,425 --> 00:15:48,201
Great Ning's first woman

276
00:15:48,225 --> 00:15:50,685
to place first in all three examinations.

277
00:15:51,145 --> 00:15:52,685
Who did you say?

278
00:15:53,385 --> 00:15:55,605
Meng Tinghui.

279
00:15:57,265 --> 00:15:58,281
Over my dead body.

280
00:15:58,305 --> 00:15:59,885
You can forget it.

281
00:16:00,625 --> 00:16:01,601
I've already chosen her.

282
00:16:01,625 --> 00:16:03,285
I will marry no one else in this life.

283
00:16:04,905 --> 00:16:06,165
-I'll...
-Put that down.

284
00:16:09,625 --> 00:16:11,001
Chancellor,

285
00:16:11,025 --> 00:16:13,725
if you had not ignored him all these years,

286
00:16:13,905 --> 00:16:15,121
how could he have reached this age

287
00:16:15,145 --> 00:16:16,565
without even discussing marriage?

288
00:16:18,345 --> 00:16:19,565
Tell me,

289
00:16:19,865 --> 00:16:20,761
have you been fair to me

290
00:16:20,785 --> 00:16:22,685
or to Ze'er?

291
00:16:23,825 --> 00:16:25,001
Don't be angry yet.

292
00:16:25,025 --> 00:16:26,321
Everyone in the capital says

293
00:16:26,345 --> 00:16:28,121
Meng Tinghui is a remarkable heroine.

294
00:16:28,145 --> 00:16:30,401
Even His Majesty favors her.

295
00:16:30,425 --> 00:16:31,801
So I went to see her for myself,

296
00:16:31,825 --> 00:16:33,001
and the trip was worthwhile.

297
00:16:33,025 --> 00:16:34,561
Miss Meng truly is

298
00:16:34,585 --> 00:16:36,641
a wonder found nowhere on earth.

299
00:16:36,665 --> 00:16:38,245
The moment I saw her,

300
00:16:38,585 --> 00:16:40,681
I knew she was the woman I would marry.

301
00:16:40,705 --> 00:16:42,085
You...

302
00:16:42,425 --> 00:16:43,765
Chancellor,

303
00:16:43,945 --> 00:16:45,641
when have you ever seen our son

304
00:16:45,665 --> 00:16:48,085
so devoted to a young woman?

305
00:16:48,985 --> 00:16:52,285
Don't you want to sever His Majesty's
feelings for Meng Tinghui?

306
00:16:53,305 --> 00:16:55,601
Then why not first bring Meng Tinghui

307
00:16:55,625 --> 00:16:57,361
into our Xu family?

308
00:16:57,385 --> 00:16:58,481
When that happens...

309
00:16:58,505 --> 00:17:00,761
I'll have her review memorials for Father
every day.

310
00:17:00,785 --> 00:17:02,401
I guarantee she'll write them ten times
better

311
00:17:02,425 --> 00:17:04,201
-than those Hanlin scholars.
-Exactly.

312
00:17:04,225 --> 00:17:06,005
Exactly what? Nonsense!

313
00:17:07,065 --> 00:17:08,921
The Xu family has served as officials for
generations.

314
00:17:08,945 --> 00:17:10,681
How could I allow a common orphan

315
00:17:10,705 --> 00:17:12,045
to disgrace our family name?

316
00:17:13,065 --> 00:17:14,001
I...

317
00:17:14,025 --> 00:17:15,361
I don't care.

318
00:17:15,385 --> 00:17:16,761
I've chosen her.

319
00:17:16,785 --> 00:17:18,361
If I cannot marry her,

320
00:17:18,385 --> 00:17:20,001
I... I'll kill myself.

321
00:17:20,025 --> 00:17:21,165
Then go die.

322
00:17:21,625 --> 00:17:24,645
How can you say such a thing?

323
00:17:28,825 --> 00:17:30,761
Look, Chancellor.

324
00:17:30,785 --> 00:17:33,121
Our son is truly in love.

325
00:17:33,145 --> 00:17:34,401
If anything happens to him,

326
00:17:34,425 --> 00:17:36,161
I... I'll hang myself too.

327
00:17:36,185 --> 00:17:37,081
I'll die right before your eyes.

328
00:17:37,105 --> 00:17:38,721
I won't live either.

329
00:17:38,745 --> 00:17:41,885
-We'll die together.
-We'll die together.

330
00:17:44,705 --> 00:17:45,965
Silence!

331
00:17:49,865 --> 00:17:51,801
Get out. Both of you, get out!

332
00:17:51,825 --> 00:17:53,765
-Fine, we're leaving.
-Fine, we're leaving.

333
00:17:57,545 --> 00:17:59,445
A doting mother ruins her son.

334
00:18:03,185 --> 00:18:05,361
Fu Zhi, where are you going?

335
00:18:05,385 --> 00:18:06,841
-Mengmeng, I was just looking for you.

336
00:18:06,865 --> 00:18:08,601
I received a letter saying Father has fallen
ill.

337
00:18:08,625 --> 00:18:10,441
He remains unconscious. I must return home.

338
00:18:10,465 --> 00:18:12,001
What illness does your father have?

339
00:18:12,025 --> 00:18:12,961
I'm not certain.

340
00:18:12,985 --> 00:18:14,485
Perhaps an old condition has returned.

341
00:18:14,705 --> 00:18:16,761
He is elderly and has
many chronic ailments.

342
00:18:16,785 --> 00:18:17,761
I need to go see him first.

343
00:18:17,785 --> 00:18:19,401
Shopkeeper, it's getting late.

344
00:18:19,425 --> 00:18:20,961
We should set out.

345
00:18:20,985 --> 00:18:22,041
Mengmeng,

346
00:18:22,065 --> 00:18:23,321
a man like Ling Yunfei

347
00:18:23,345 --> 00:18:24,681
will never wait quietly for his fate.

348
00:18:24,705 --> 00:18:25,841
While I'm away,

349
00:18:25,865 --> 00:18:26,761
you must be extremely careful.

350
00:18:26,785 --> 00:18:29,121
Don't worry. I will act cautiously.

351
00:18:29,145 --> 00:18:31,121
Go home and care for your father without
concern.

352
00:18:31,145 --> 00:18:32,725
All right. I'm leaving.

353
00:18:35,465 --> 00:18:36,765
Be careful on the road.

354
00:18:47,465 --> 00:18:49,401
Young Mistress, Madam had the kitchen

355
00:18:49,425 --> 00:18:51,041
prepare Dong'e donkey-hide gelatin soup for
you.

356
00:18:51,065 --> 00:18:52,561
I know.

357
00:18:52,585 --> 00:18:53,925
I'll drink it after I finish painting.

358
00:18:59,465 --> 00:19:00,645
There's also this.

359
00:19:01,225 --> 00:19:03,245
The Right Chancellor sent you a painting

360
00:19:03,465 --> 00:19:06,005
and insisted it be delivered into your own
hands.

361
00:19:07,145 --> 00:19:08,405
Set it down.

362
00:19:26,305 --> 00:19:28,205
Bamboo grows straight,

363
00:19:28,625 --> 00:19:30,365
and pruning makes it flourish.

364
00:19:35,025 --> 00:19:37,681
Your teacher knows that you have had doubts
lately

365
00:19:37,705 --> 00:19:39,601
and have grown distant from him.

366
00:19:39,625 --> 00:19:40,841
Affairs of court

367
00:19:40,865 --> 00:19:42,925
are not as simple as they appear.

368
00:19:43,465 --> 00:19:45,485
Though the Bureau of Intelligence serves as
the court's eyes and ears,

369
00:19:45,705 --> 00:19:47,525
its conduct has recently begun to stray.

370
00:19:47,945 --> 00:19:49,401
If it is not corrected,

371
00:19:49,425 --> 00:19:50,965
it may bring about a great disaster.

372
00:19:51,985 --> 00:19:53,601
Everything your teacher said and did in the
hall

373
00:19:53,625 --> 00:19:54,601
was for the court,

374
00:19:54,625 --> 00:19:56,525
the people, and the greater good.

375
00:19:56,945 --> 00:19:58,285
I hope you can understand.

376
00:19:59,825 --> 00:20:01,445
Only by remaining true to your original
purpose

377
00:20:01,825 --> 00:20:04,365
can you avoid being
deceived by appearances.

378
00:20:06,065 --> 00:20:07,765
Teacher means to tell me

379
00:20:08,425 --> 00:20:10,161
that everything he has done

380
00:20:10,185 --> 00:20:12,405
was meant to restrain improper conduct

381
00:20:12,945 --> 00:20:14,205
and allow the Bureau of Intelligence

382
00:20:14,825 --> 00:20:16,325
to develop in a more orderly way.

383
00:20:22,665 --> 00:20:24,921
Your Majesty is in excellent spirits
tonight.

384
00:20:24,945 --> 00:20:26,885
Seeing you so happy gladdens this old
servant too.

385
00:20:27,465 --> 00:20:29,201
Your Majesty, look at these carp.

386
00:20:29,225 --> 00:20:30,641
They compete for food, full of vitality.

387
00:20:30,665 --> 00:20:32,641
They symbolize Great Ning's

388
00:20:32,665 --> 00:20:34,405
peace and prosperity.

389
00:20:34,705 --> 00:20:35,845
Your Majesty.

390
00:20:36,705 --> 00:20:37,845
Your Majesty.

391
00:20:38,265 --> 00:20:39,921
-Your Majesty.
-Assistant Commissioner Shen.

392
00:20:39,945 --> 00:20:41,525
An urgent confidential dispatch from eight
hundred li away.

393
00:20:44,265 --> 00:20:45,561
While investigating in secret,

394
00:20:45,585 --> 00:20:47,241
I discovered a private mine on the border

395
00:20:47,265 --> 00:20:48,561
between Great Ning's Qingzhou and Beijian.

396
00:20:48,585 --> 00:20:50,285
There are signs weapons were forged inside.

397
00:20:50,625 --> 00:20:52,241
This area lies in the heartland of the
former state of Zhongwan.

398
00:20:52,265 --> 00:20:53,481
More troubling still,

399
00:20:53,505 --> 00:20:55,885
Beijian's border troops have recently made
repeated provocations.

400
00:20:56,545 --> 00:20:57,801
Huang Bo.

401
00:20:57,825 --> 00:21:00,321
Send this order at once to the Qingzhou
military camp

402
00:21:00,345 --> 00:21:01,401
and deliver it to General Huo Dewei.

403
00:21:01,425 --> 00:21:03,481
Order him to send men through the night to
reinforce Zhishu.

404
00:21:03,505 --> 00:21:05,561
Yes, Your Majesty.

405
00:21:05,585 --> 00:21:07,281
The clues in the weapons case have gone in
circles

406
00:21:07,305 --> 00:21:08,765
only to return to the former lands of
Zhongwan.

407
00:21:09,065 --> 00:21:10,605
If Beijian is involved as well...

408
00:21:11,105 --> 00:21:13,005
This is becoming more interesting.

409
00:21:22,105 --> 00:21:24,081
Shen Zhishu followed you in secret,

410
00:21:24,105 --> 00:21:25,681
yet none of you noticed?

411
00:21:25,705 --> 00:21:28,365
Had sir not sent me to guard you,

412
00:21:28,665 --> 00:21:30,125
we would already have been exposed.

413
00:21:30,385 --> 00:21:31,725
Sir has said

414
00:21:32,465 --> 00:21:33,925
the Blood Moon Society

415
00:21:34,865 --> 00:21:36,645
keeps no useless people.

416
00:21:38,385 --> 00:21:39,321
Sir.

417
00:21:39,345 --> 00:21:40,961
Please give us one more chance.

418
00:21:40,985 --> 00:21:42,165
Have mercy, sir.

419
00:21:42,825 --> 00:21:43,721
Sir,

420
00:21:43,745 --> 00:21:44,961
Si Jian, Si Qi, and I

421
00:21:44,985 --> 00:21:46,681
were all personally trained by you.

422
00:21:46,705 --> 00:21:48,241
We are utterly loyal to Zhongwan.

423
00:21:48,265 --> 00:21:51,081
If they are eliminated over one mistake
today,

424
00:21:51,105 --> 00:21:53,085
it may be difficult to find people this
trustworthy again.

425
00:21:53,625 --> 00:21:55,361
Please give them another chance.

426
00:21:55,385 --> 00:21:57,885
I am willing to accept their punishment.

427
00:22:00,985 --> 00:22:03,525
I will let today's matter pass for now.

428
00:22:04,025 --> 00:22:06,445
The great cause of restoring our nation
cannot tolerate failure.

429
00:22:07,465 --> 00:22:08,885
If it happens again,

430
00:22:09,545 --> 00:22:10,885
you will not be spared.

431
00:22:11,465 --> 00:22:12,885
Thank you, sir.

432
00:22:15,265 --> 00:22:17,445
Thank you for your mercy, sir.

433
00:22:17,785 --> 00:22:19,481
We will remember it well

434
00:22:19,505 --> 00:22:21,081
and ensure the great cause proceeds
smoothly.

435
00:22:21,105 --> 00:22:23,681
Since that dog emperor
has grown suspicious,

436
00:22:23,705 --> 00:22:25,245
suspend the forging for now.

437
00:22:25,545 --> 00:22:26,885
That dog emperor

438
00:22:27,105 --> 00:22:29,441
has hounded us relentlessly since Shazhou

439
00:22:29,465 --> 00:22:30,841
and disrupted many of our plans.

440
00:22:30,865 --> 00:22:31,961
Sir,

441
00:22:31,985 --> 00:22:33,681
this mission was not entirely without gain.

442
00:22:33,705 --> 00:22:35,721
My men have finally
located the Fuqing herb.

443
00:22:35,745 --> 00:22:37,481
The poison-pill plan you have long prepared

444
00:22:37,505 --> 00:22:38,965
can now be carried out.

445
00:22:40,585 --> 00:22:41,801
Sir,

446
00:22:41,825 --> 00:22:43,281
regarding the poison-pill plan,

447
00:22:43,305 --> 00:22:45,005
I also have an important matter to report.

448
00:22:45,585 --> 00:22:47,561
Two days ago, a distinguished guest came to
Huiyin House.

449
00:22:47,585 --> 00:22:49,401
He was listless when he arrived,

450
00:22:49,425 --> 00:22:51,161
but after taking one pill,

451
00:22:51,185 --> 00:22:53,321
he instantly became energetic and euphoric.

452
00:22:53,345 --> 00:22:55,081
Si Qin grew suspicious

453
00:22:55,105 --> 00:22:56,481
and used hypnosis on him.

454
00:22:56,505 --> 00:22:58,281
She learned that although the pill was
somewhat weaker,

455
00:22:58,305 --> 00:23:00,281
it worked in much the same way

456
00:23:00,305 --> 00:23:02,085
as the poison pill you have planned.

457
00:23:14,265 --> 00:23:15,161
At present,

458
00:23:15,185 --> 00:23:18,041
the pill circulates secretly only among
wealthy merchants.

459
00:23:18,065 --> 00:23:19,001
I have also discovered

460
00:23:19,025 --> 00:23:20,041
that this merchant

461
00:23:20,065 --> 00:23:21,921
will soon conduct another transaction.

462
00:23:21,945 --> 00:23:23,921
The other party is called Lü Da.

463
00:23:23,945 --> 00:23:25,361
I never expected the Tiger Roar Gang

464
00:23:25,385 --> 00:23:27,881
to involve itself in such sinister goods.

465
00:23:27,905 --> 00:23:30,085
Since they have already achieved some
success,

466
00:23:30,425 --> 00:23:31,881
we shall use their momentum

467
00:23:31,905 --> 00:23:33,725
and turn this situation to our advantage.

468
00:23:34,025 --> 00:23:35,681
Ying Gua may be powerful,

469
00:23:35,705 --> 00:23:38,041
but Great Ning is not united.

470
00:23:38,065 --> 00:23:40,001
When the time is right,

471
00:23:40,025 --> 00:23:41,401
Zhongwan

472
00:23:41,425 --> 00:23:44,085
will see daylight once more.

473
00:23:44,545 --> 00:23:45,841
The Mystic Bird shall never perish.

474
00:23:45,865 --> 00:23:47,761
The Blood Moon shall endure forever.

475
00:23:47,785 --> 00:23:49,161
The Mystic Bird shall never perish.

476
00:23:49,185 --> 00:23:51,205
The Blood Moon shall endure forever.

477
00:23:56,265 --> 00:23:57,525
Master Lü.

478
00:24:13,665 --> 00:24:14,885
Master Lü.

479
00:24:15,625 --> 00:24:16,521
Please show mercy

480
00:24:16,545 --> 00:24:17,881
and put in a word with the gang leader.

481
00:24:17,905 --> 00:24:19,521
The pleasure from this stuff

482
00:24:19,545 --> 00:24:21,405
doesn't even last half a quarter-hour
anymore.

483
00:24:24,225 --> 00:24:26,005
Please don't be angry.

484
00:24:52,865 --> 00:24:54,481
I came today

485
00:24:54,505 --> 00:24:57,125
to offer the Tiger Roar Gang a road to
riches.

486
00:24:58,225 --> 00:24:59,445
What do you mean?

487
00:24:59,905 --> 00:25:01,641
What you sell

488
00:25:01,665 --> 00:25:03,481
is merely a mixture of
Five Minerals Powder.

489
00:25:03,505 --> 00:25:04,685
Its ingredients conflict,

490
00:25:05,345 --> 00:25:07,521
and addiction only appears after seven
consecutive days.

491
00:25:07,545 --> 00:25:09,045
Few customers return,

492
00:25:09,825 --> 00:25:11,765
so you earn only a paltry profit.

493
00:25:13,105 --> 00:25:14,645
Who exactly are you?

494
00:25:20,385 --> 00:25:22,725
Someone offering you great wealth.

495
00:25:23,505 --> 00:25:25,041
This is the Wuqiong Pill.

496
00:25:25,065 --> 00:25:27,921
One lick feels like ants gnawing at the
marrow.

497
00:25:27,945 --> 00:25:29,481
A single pill is enough.

498
00:25:29,505 --> 00:25:32,081
From princes and nobles to street beggars,

499
00:25:32,105 --> 00:25:33,521
no one can resist it.

500
00:25:33,545 --> 00:25:35,405
Then mountains of gold and seas of silver

501
00:25:35,745 --> 00:25:37,485
will be yours for the taking.

502
00:25:38,705 --> 00:25:40,965
If you possess something so powerful,

503
00:25:41,145 --> 00:25:43,001
why come to us?

504
00:25:43,025 --> 00:25:44,721
The ingredients for the Wuqiong Pill

505
00:25:44,745 --> 00:25:46,685
all come from remote borderlands.

506
00:25:47,225 --> 00:25:49,281
I also command twelve poison physicians,

507
00:25:49,305 --> 00:25:50,885
all masters of refinement.

508
00:25:51,465 --> 00:25:53,441
Though we can produce the Wuqiong Pill,

509
00:25:53,465 --> 00:25:55,041
spreading it throughout Great Ning

510
00:25:55,065 --> 00:25:57,085
will ultimately require
the Tiger Roar Gang.

511
00:25:57,545 --> 00:26:00,165
This is a perfect partnership.

512
00:26:16,225 --> 00:26:17,881
What exactly

513
00:26:17,905 --> 00:26:19,245
do you intend?

514
00:26:20,265 --> 00:26:21,885
All the bustle of the world

515
00:26:22,665 --> 00:26:24,005
is driven by profit.

516
00:26:24,425 --> 00:26:25,805
Who under Heaven

517
00:26:26,185 --> 00:26:28,245
would complain that silver burns their
hands?

518
00:26:29,625 --> 00:26:31,565
Take this Wuqiong Pill.

519
00:26:32,665 --> 00:26:34,325
One trial will tell you everything.

520
00:26:38,225 --> 00:26:40,081
At midnight three days from now,

521
00:26:40,105 --> 00:26:42,085
have your gang leader come here.

522
00:26:42,665 --> 00:26:45,045
Mr. Shangguan will await him to discuss a
great enterprise.

523
00:27:06,665 --> 00:27:08,561
Pavilion Master Liu, have mercy.

524
00:27:08,585 --> 00:27:10,361
My husband must have been drunk

525
00:27:10,385 --> 00:27:12,365
when he signed away my daughter's freedom.

526
00:27:12,705 --> 00:27:13,841
Pavilion Master Liu,

527
00:27:13,865 --> 00:27:15,885
I know you have treated us very well,

528
00:27:16,345 --> 00:27:17,681
but I do not want

529
00:27:17,705 --> 00:27:19,161
A-Nan to repeat my fate.

530
00:27:19,185 --> 00:27:20,605
Why are you crying?

531
00:27:21,585 --> 00:27:23,641
Evening Fragrance Pavilion is not the Hall
of Yama.

532
00:27:23,665 --> 00:27:25,005
The door is there.

533
00:27:25,425 --> 00:27:26,725
Anyone who wants to leave

534
00:27:27,785 --> 00:27:28,925
can get out now.

535
00:27:29,265 --> 00:27:30,521
Go.

536
00:27:30,545 --> 00:27:31,965
Go.

537
00:27:32,505 --> 00:27:33,805
Pavilion Master Liu.

538
00:27:34,865 --> 00:27:36,681
This little wretch tried to run.

539
00:27:36,705 --> 00:27:38,605
I brought her back.

540
00:27:39,105 --> 00:27:41,085
One pill for one girl.

541
00:27:41,345 --> 00:27:43,885
I know the rules.

542
00:28:04,985 --> 00:28:07,605
Thank you, Pavilion Master Liu.

543
00:28:11,705 --> 00:28:13,641
Father, I want to go home.

544
00:28:13,665 --> 00:28:15,285
Get lost.

545
00:28:23,225 --> 00:28:24,485
Pavilion Master Liu,

546
00:28:24,985 --> 00:28:27,321
please let me go home.

547
00:28:27,345 --> 00:28:29,045
I want to go home.

548
00:28:30,825 --> 00:28:33,565
How many times has
your father sold you now?

549
00:28:38,185 --> 00:28:39,645
Still not awake?

550
00:28:41,625 --> 00:28:43,401
But I don't want to sell myself.

551
00:28:43,425 --> 00:28:44,965
Sell yourself?

552
00:28:46,185 --> 00:28:47,881
That is the lowest path.

553
00:28:47,905 --> 00:28:49,125
Xiangning,

554
00:28:49,505 --> 00:28:50,645
tell them

555
00:28:51,465 --> 00:28:52,845
why you chose to stay.

556
00:28:56,145 --> 00:28:57,521
At Evening Fragrance Pavilion,

557
00:28:57,545 --> 00:28:59,365
I never please men.

558
00:28:59,705 --> 00:29:01,841
I make men please me.

559
00:29:01,865 --> 00:29:05,085
I learn the skills that make renowned
gentlemen bow before me.

560
00:29:05,585 --> 00:29:07,725
Even scholars

561
00:29:08,025 --> 00:29:09,805
must treat me with respect.

562
00:29:17,025 --> 00:29:18,521
You have followed me for so many years.

563
00:29:18,545 --> 00:29:19,685
Do you still not understand me?

564
00:29:20,825 --> 00:29:23,405
Children are what I love most.

565
00:29:23,985 --> 00:29:26,645
Tomorrow, I will hire a teacher for your
daughter

566
00:29:27,465 --> 00:29:28,725
so she can study properly.

567
00:29:29,065 --> 00:29:30,605
Quickly, kowtow to Pavilion Master Liu.

568
00:29:31,105 --> 00:29:32,281
Thank you, Pavilion Master Liu.

569
00:29:32,305 --> 00:29:33,645
Thank you, Pavilion Master Liu.

570
00:29:34,065 --> 00:29:35,205
Remember.

571
00:29:35,825 --> 00:29:37,925
Those who enter my pavilion are sisters.

572
00:29:38,265 --> 00:29:39,645
Those who leave it

573
00:29:39,945 --> 00:29:41,285
stand above others.

574
00:29:41,545 --> 00:29:43,241
Do you know why these officials

575
00:29:43,265 --> 00:29:46,165
allow Evening Fragrance Pavilion to exist?

576
00:29:47,345 --> 00:29:48,525
Xiangning.

577
00:29:54,785 --> 00:29:56,405
Because evidence of their crimes

578
00:29:58,185 --> 00:29:59,565
is all kept here.

579
00:30:01,305 --> 00:30:04,005
Will you be ants crushed beneath others'
feet,

580
00:30:05,065 --> 00:30:07,325
or magnificent phoenixes?

581
00:30:08,665 --> 00:30:10,085
Choose for yourselves.

582
00:30:20,545 --> 00:30:22,565
Pavilion Master Liu, I want to stay.

583
00:30:23,625 --> 00:30:25,805
Pavilion Master Liu, I want to stay too.

584
00:30:29,065 --> 00:30:30,285
We want to stay as well.

585
00:30:31,665 --> 00:30:33,641
-I'll stay too.
-So will I.

586
00:30:33,665 --> 00:30:36,045
Now those are worthy girls of Evening
Fragrance Pavilion.

587
00:30:36,585 --> 00:30:37,725
Xiangning,

588
00:30:38,225 --> 00:30:39,685
take them to the training room.

589
00:31:07,385 --> 00:31:09,245
Why are you in such a hurry?

590
00:31:26,145 --> 00:31:27,605
Strange.

591
00:31:28,225 --> 00:31:30,441
The Tiger Roar Gang has vanished recently.

592
00:31:30,465 --> 00:31:32,481
There has been no news of them at all.

593
00:31:32,505 --> 00:31:34,441
Could they have heard something?

594
00:31:34,465 --> 00:31:35,441
In my view,

595
00:31:35,465 --> 00:31:36,401
those bandits

596
00:31:36,425 --> 00:31:38,361
must be plotting something enormous.

597
00:31:38,385 --> 00:31:39,521
Lord Meng,

598
00:31:39,545 --> 00:31:41,125
eat something.

599
00:31:42,545 --> 00:31:44,405
The Tiger Roar Gang matter cannot be
delayed.

600
00:31:44,745 --> 00:31:46,645
Zhili, you are skilled at deduction.

601
00:31:48,465 --> 00:31:49,441
Could you try

602
00:31:49,465 --> 00:31:51,485
drawing a portrait of the elusive Ling
Yunfei?

603
00:31:52,585 --> 00:31:53,845
That sounds interesting.

604
00:31:54,105 --> 00:31:55,481
Although no one has seen his true face,

605
00:31:55,505 --> 00:31:57,921
we can gather information and let me try.

606
00:31:57,945 --> 00:31:59,281
Let's leave at once

607
00:31:59,305 --> 00:32:00,361
and split up to search

608
00:32:00,385 --> 00:32:02,085
for any trace of Ling Yunfei.

609
00:32:28,825 --> 00:32:30,081
The leader of the Tiger Roar Gang

610
00:32:30,105 --> 00:32:31,805
abducted thirteen women

611
00:32:32,265 --> 00:32:33,921
and robbed the Sun family's caravan.

612
00:32:33,945 --> 00:32:35,361
Where did you hear all that?

613
00:32:35,385 --> 00:32:36,281
Assistant Commissioner Shen,

614
00:32:36,305 --> 00:32:38,001
everything in those storybooks is made up.

615
00:32:38,025 --> 00:32:39,481
I've never seen the
leader of the Tiger Roar Gang.

616
00:32:39,505 --> 00:32:40,761
But it is clearly written here.

617
00:32:40,785 --> 00:32:42,005
It's all false.

618
00:32:51,025 --> 00:32:52,165
I never expected

619
00:32:52,705 --> 00:32:54,041
someone to be so uncooperative.

620
00:32:54,065 --> 00:32:56,685
I have heard one secret story.

621
00:33:08,905 --> 00:33:10,045
That's him.

622
00:33:21,105 --> 00:33:22,481
If we mean to eliminate her,

623
00:33:22,505 --> 00:33:24,161
why not simply bind her and throw her into
the river?

624
00:33:24,185 --> 00:33:25,241
Just as we did

625
00:33:25,265 --> 00:33:26,961
to Censor Zhou the year before last.

626
00:33:26,985 --> 00:33:28,081
Clean and efficient.

627
00:33:28,105 --> 00:33:31,045
Killing her would only
secure her good name.

628
00:33:31,945 --> 00:33:33,285
To destroy her,

629
00:33:33,865 --> 00:33:36,041
we must drag her into the mud

630
00:33:36,065 --> 00:33:37,565
and ruin her reputation.

631
00:33:38,465 --> 00:33:40,681
Did you use such despicable methods

632
00:33:40,705 --> 00:33:41,761
to tame Sister-in-law back then?

633
00:33:41,785 --> 00:33:42,965
Shut up.

634
00:33:43,225 --> 00:33:45,121
Who is more despicable than you?

635
00:33:45,145 --> 00:33:48,081
Even a courtesan old enough to be your
mother

636
00:33:48,105 --> 00:33:49,685
has you completely obsessed.

637
00:34:01,185 --> 00:34:04,045
Had she not saved me
from despair back then,

638
00:34:04,545 --> 00:34:06,645
I would already be dead.

639
00:34:07,065 --> 00:34:08,765
And you would not be here today.

640
00:34:11,145 --> 00:34:13,045
If you insult her again,

641
00:34:13,825 --> 00:34:16,565
I will tie you up and deliver you to Meng
Tinghui.

642
00:34:17,585 --> 00:34:19,125
Then we can die together.

643
00:34:21,825 --> 00:34:23,525
Did you hear me,

644
00:34:24,105 --> 00:34:25,605
Brother?

645
00:34:33,625 --> 00:34:34,765
Fine.

646
00:34:35,385 --> 00:34:36,441
What a devoted lover.

647
00:34:36,465 --> 00:34:38,321
Since you refuse to act,

648
00:34:38,345 --> 00:34:39,845
keep your whereabouts hidden.

649
00:34:40,345 --> 00:34:42,645
I will deal with Meng Tinghui.

650
00:34:44,705 --> 00:34:46,601
No one is better than Brother

651
00:34:46,625 --> 00:34:48,205
at such underhanded methods.

652
00:34:48,785 --> 00:34:50,965
I look forward to seeing

653
00:34:52,225 --> 00:34:53,725
how vile you can be this time.

654
00:35:09,545 --> 00:35:10,761
Gang Leader.

655
00:35:10,785 --> 00:35:12,565
This is the agreed location.

656
00:35:16,225 --> 00:35:18,285
Gang Leader Ling is indeed punctual.

657
00:35:19,905 --> 00:35:21,485
I assume you have already experienced

658
00:35:22,305 --> 00:35:24,321
the wonders of the Wuqiong Pill.

659
00:35:24,345 --> 00:35:26,721
But I want a lasting business.

660
00:35:26,745 --> 00:35:28,965
That man died before a full day had passed.

661
00:35:29,305 --> 00:35:31,521
Do you expect me to
collect payment from the King of Hell?

662
00:35:31,545 --> 00:35:33,005
The dosage can be adjusted.

663
00:35:33,465 --> 00:35:35,761
With a slight change to the formula,

664
00:35:35,785 --> 00:35:38,041
I can make a person unable to live

665
00:35:38,065 --> 00:35:39,681
and unable to die.

666
00:35:39,705 --> 00:35:42,845
First show overwhelming force, then reveal
your true offer.

667
00:35:43,625 --> 00:35:45,085
Mr. Shangguan,

668
00:35:45,545 --> 00:35:47,645
you truly understand negotiation.

669
00:35:47,905 --> 00:35:49,121
However,

670
00:35:49,145 --> 00:35:51,445
can you truly guarantee an endless supply

671
00:35:52,545 --> 00:35:55,161
of something this irresistible?

672
00:35:55,185 --> 00:35:57,241
I have chosen Wangxian Valley outside the
capital

673
00:35:57,265 --> 00:35:58,961
to cultivate the Fuqing herb

674
00:35:58,985 --> 00:36:00,485
and refine the Wuqiong Pill.

675
00:36:01,185 --> 00:36:03,321
The mountains are deep and the forest dense.
No one will know.

676
00:36:03,345 --> 00:36:05,281
Gang Leader Ling need only agree,

677
00:36:05,305 --> 00:36:07,285
and our partnership will be sealed.

678
00:36:08,305 --> 00:36:11,365
Mr. Shangguan has indeed considered
everything.

679
00:36:13,065 --> 00:36:16,085
How do you intend to divide this cup of
poisoned wine?

680
00:36:17,945 --> 00:36:19,205
I want sixty percent.

681
00:36:20,745 --> 00:36:23,525
After all, before those addicts die,

682
00:36:24,065 --> 00:36:26,205
it is the Tiger Roar Gang's name they will
cry out.

683
00:36:27,865 --> 00:36:30,085
Agreed. We have a long future ahead.

684
00:36:30,385 --> 00:36:32,841
Once the Wuqiong Pill spreads throughout
Great Ning,

685
00:36:32,865 --> 00:36:35,321
you will willingly surrender that small
share.

686
00:36:35,345 --> 00:36:36,805
Straightforward.

687
00:36:37,345 --> 00:36:38,845
But since we are partners,

688
00:36:39,825 --> 00:36:42,165
why not show your true face?

689
00:36:42,545 --> 00:36:44,925
If Gang Leader Ling wishes to see it,

690
00:36:46,065 --> 00:36:47,965
you may have to exchange your life for the
privilege.

691
00:36:59,225 --> 00:37:01,365
One whistle sounds, and a hundred ghosts
obey.

692
00:37:02,025 --> 00:37:03,485
When this whistle is blown,

693
00:37:03,865 --> 00:37:05,681
those who took the drug become puppets on
strings,

694
00:37:05,705 --> 00:37:07,045
ready to obey your every command.

695
00:37:11,065 --> 00:37:12,281
Gang Leader,

696
00:37:12,305 --> 00:37:14,681
he vanished just as mysteriously last time.

697
00:37:14,705 --> 00:37:16,481
I have never met anyone in this world

698
00:37:16,505 --> 00:37:18,761
more arrogant than you.

699
00:37:18,785 --> 00:37:20,325
This little bone whistle...

700
00:37:21,025 --> 00:37:22,681
If it can truly command hounds and wolves,

701
00:37:22,705 --> 00:37:24,321
then he does possess some ability.

702
00:37:24,345 --> 00:37:25,485
By the way, Gang Leader,

703
00:37:26,025 --> 00:37:28,565
the entire capital

704
00:37:28,945 --> 00:37:30,565
is now covered with your portrait.

705
00:37:32,305 --> 00:37:33,565
A wanted notice?

706
00:37:36,385 --> 00:37:37,525
Her again.

707
00:37:37,785 --> 00:37:39,965
Who else could it be but Meng Tinghui?

708
00:37:42,785 --> 00:37:45,321
Still, the artist is rather skilled.

709
00:37:45,345 --> 00:37:47,965
It bears some resemblance to me.

710
00:37:48,625 --> 00:37:50,085
Especially the eyes.

711
00:37:50,745 --> 00:37:51,885
Let them post it.

712
00:37:52,585 --> 00:37:53,965
Our business continues as usual.

713
00:37:56,065 --> 00:37:57,685
The person in the court

714
00:37:57,865 --> 00:37:59,485
is more anxious than we are.

715
00:38:10,145 --> 00:38:11,401
Huang Bo.

716
00:38:11,425 --> 00:38:12,761
Prepare a carriage.

717
00:38:12,785 --> 00:38:13,961
I will leave the palace alone.

718
00:38:13,985 --> 00:38:14,881
You need not follow.

719
00:38:14,905 --> 00:38:17,401
How can Your Majesty leave the palace
without protection?

720
00:38:17,425 --> 00:38:18,841
The shadow guards must accompany you,

721
00:38:18,865 --> 00:38:20,601
and I must go as well.

722
00:38:20,625 --> 00:38:22,361
I am going to see Meng Tinghui,

723
00:38:22,385 --> 00:38:23,961
not entering a dragon's
lair or tiger's den.

724
00:38:23,985 --> 00:38:25,681
No arrangements are necessary.

725
00:38:25,705 --> 00:38:27,921
Your Majesty, have I done something wrong?

726
00:38:27,945 --> 00:38:29,241
Why will you no longer
let me accompany you?

727
00:38:29,265 --> 00:38:31,481
Lord Meng surely would not mind my coming
along.

728
00:38:31,505 --> 00:38:32,885
I would.

729
00:38:33,185 --> 00:38:35,285
Stop talking and make the preparations.

730
00:38:35,785 --> 00:38:37,125
I will go at once.

731
00:39:03,825 --> 00:39:06,765
I said I need no attendants. Leave.

732
00:39:30,665 --> 00:39:32,085
Your Majesty, save me.

733
00:39:32,385 --> 00:39:33,565
Insolence!

734
00:39:34,265 --> 00:39:35,885
How dare you trespass here?

735
00:39:36,265 --> 00:39:37,765
Who gave you such audacity?

736
00:40:01,585 --> 00:40:02,725
He Du...

737
00:40:11,625 --> 00:40:13,485
We clearly agreed on this hour.

738
00:40:14,385 --> 00:40:15,965
Why has he still not arrived?

